3. DATA AND PRIVACY

3.1 The Software runs locally on your machine. It has no account system and
    transmits no telemetry, usage statistics, or crash reports to the Licensor.
3.2 The index the Software builds, the document text it extracts, and all
    configuration are stored in a data directory on your own machine and are
    not uploaded to any server.
3.3 The Software includes one optional feature, "AI regex generation", which is
    disabled by default. Only if You configure an API key for a third-party
    model service and actively invoke the feature will the Software transmit
    (a) the natural-language description You typed and (b) any sample text You
    chose to paste, to the endpoint You designated. Your file contents, index
    data, and search history are never transmitted.
3.4 Your relationship with that third-party model service is governed by that
